parallel.py adapts LTX2AudioVideoAttnProcessor from Hugging Face Diffusers.
Copyright 2025 The Lightricks team and The HuggingFace Team.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see LICENSE.diffusers.

The adaptation keeps prompt keys and values replicated, shards video/audio queries,
and exchanges the unequal video/audio sequences before the Runtime-selected attention.
Source: https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers/blob/43e30028af5120d8b0868cb6975b9fad39cc4fab/src/diffusers/models/transformers/transformer_ltx2.py
